# Dusknote per-deployer configuration. Copy to .env.local for local dev, or set it as an
# environment variable in your Vercel project. There is exactly one value.

# Your Google OAuth Client ID (from your own Google Cloud project — the setup guide walks
# through creating it). Public by design, not a secret. Leave empty until you have one;
# without it the app works fully on-device, with Google Sheet backup switched off.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# That's all. Everything you'd personalize (what you call the thing you track, your
# vocabulary, rating words, watched factors, the name on your report) lives inside the
# app itself, as your data — Settings and Log options, not configuration.
